{{define "preheader"}}Use this link to choose a new password. It expires in 1 hour.{{end}}
{{define "heading"}}Reset your password{{end}}
{{define "button"}}Choose a new password{{end}}
{{define "why"}}You are receiving this because a password reset was requested for this address.{{end}}
{{define "body"}}
<p class="ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#131722;">{{if .Name}}Hello {{.Name}},{{else}}Hello,{{end}}</p>
<p class="ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#131722;">We received a request to reset the password for your RightProperty365 account.</p>
<p class="ink" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#131722;">The link works once and expires 1 hour after this email was sent. Choosing a new password signs you out on every device.</p>
<p class="muted" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#4f586a;">If you did not ask for this, ignore this email. Your password stays the same.</p>
{{end}}
